{"channelId":"UCNRXX10yVo3NqmcxlAeDlPw","row":["HappyLand Animal Shelter & Pet Adoption",8,"Welcome to Happyland Animal Shelter, your premier destination for heartwarming rescue stories and finding your new best friend! As a dedicated animal rescue and adoption company, our mission is to transform the lives of abandoned, neglected, and senior pets by providing them with a second chance at a joyful life. On this channel, we take you behind the scenes of our daily operations, from the first moment a rescue arrives at our doors to the emotional \"Gotcha Day\" when they head to a forever home. Explore our educational guides on pet care, behavior training tips, and deep dives into the unique personalities of our current residents. Whether you are looking to adopt, foster, or simply support animal welfare, our community is for you. Join us in making the world kinder, one paw at a time. Subscribe now to witness the power of love and help us find every pet their Happyland!","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNRXX10yVo3NqmcxlAeDlPw","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNRXX10yVo3NqmcxlAeDlPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:55.337Z","channelId":"UCNRXX10yVo3NqmcxlAeDlPw","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"e42fe122eb0b9505e82367bf44b28a1de57c870f920dcd16e3c396ac7f9c3a63","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"d272ab8d402dc0bc5f713fca472e1af6a46d68b37d8742c36d46e787ee7338d9"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNRXX10yVo3NqmcxlAeDlPw","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":8,"raw":"8 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNRXX10yVo3NqmcxlAeDlPw","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:55.337Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["animal rescue"],"relevantKeywords":["animal rescue"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"animal rescue","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"organiza